                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d4e28c22-9251-411a-9bf9-fef1687c85fb",
                        "source_entry_id": "61d8214e-930e-3e49-af4d-85787cda15b8",
                        "source_sense_id": "a0bd34f1-b138-38c8-a553-f6e1194fc343",
                        "target_lang_word": "axiological",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "axiological",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "56880072-a4b7-324e-96f5-1cc8f3ccf9db",
                                        "entry_id": "12e74872-4b48-3ef3-8e4d-3fc1b1e5945d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of or relating to value theory, the philosophical field of axiology."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f1fd3e30-79d6-4227-9021-a1649b8b090d",
                                                "sense_id": "56880072-a4b7-324e-96f5-1cc8f3ccf9db",
                                                "text": "Students of psychology and epistemology are familiar with the axiological literature of the last forty years, and are here reminded of the great diversity of opinions on this topic."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ad03d410-3a7a-381c-8bbf-a240c3b84d1f",
                                        "entry_id": "12e74872-4b48-3ef3-8e4d-3fc1b1e5945d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of or relating to values themselves."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6c2a563c-44d3-49dc-8251-a07f40e74b6f",
                                                "sense_id": "ad03d410-3a7a-381c-8bbf-a240c3b84d1f",
                                                "text": "It might now be thought that the object of this judgment is the validity of value or an axiological validity (as distinct from a theoretical validity)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "79092a42-f1ff-4272-a3a9-46a31efb5e21",
                        "source_entry_id": "61d8214e-930e-3e49-af4d-85787cda15b8",
                        "source_sense_id": "a0bd34f1-b138-38c8-a553-f6e1194fc343",
                        "target_lang_word": "axiologique",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "axiologique",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "06e97900-a356-3167-8a8e-43216b715028",
                                        "entry_id": "bb20be12-1931-3fb4-a5b1-abc4d102f57a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Relatif à l’axiologie, aux valeurs."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4697761d-7951-42c0-aea9-7ad491c7ee90",
                                                "sense_id": "06e97900-a356-3167-8a8e-43216b715028",
                                                "text": "En France, un courant axiologique « spiritualiste » s'est développé autour notamment de Louis Lavelle."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d9538fae-931e-4cdc-ae53-d973e5f631b3",
                                                "sense_id": "06e97900-a356-3167-8a8e-43216b715028",
                                                "text": "Pourtant, cet « économisme » sur lequel il revient longuement est bourré de contradictions. Il récompense sans distinction ceux qui contribuent ou non au bien social, il prétend à une forme de neutralité axiologique mais masque les relations de pouvoir et « décourage l’évaluation politique des structures et des pratiques qui subordonnent la démocratie aux intérêts matériels à court terme d’une minorité privilégiée. »"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5daeace8-c723-4b3a-90ab-d5cbbba2d727",
                        "source_entry_id": "61d8214e-930e-3e49-af4d-85787cda15b8",
                        "source_sense_id": "a0bd34f1-b138-38c8-a553-f6e1194fc343",
